        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Visy Industries\n- People: Richard Pratt\n- Places: Melbourne, Australia\n- Topics: paper, packaging, recycling, private ownership\n\nFacts:\n- Visy Industries was established in Melbourne, Australia in 1948.\n- Visy Industries grew to become one of the world's largest privately owned paper, packaging, and recycling companies.\n- Richard Pratt owned Visy Industries and served as the company's chairman.\n- Richard Pratt was a prominent Australian businessman and a leading figure in Melbourne society.\n- Richard Pratt died on 28 April 2009.",
